    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement by a Sorcerer)</em></p><p>Ribbons of many-colored light swirl inside this magic glass orb.</p><p><strong>Sorcerous Reservoir.</strong> While holding the orb, you can take a Magic action to regain up to 2 expended Sorcery Points. Once this property is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p><p><strong>Spellcasting Focus.</strong> You can use the orb as a Spellcasting Focus for your Sorcerer spells.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-2fE6uKiN5s4Kyovt\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Sorcerous Reservoir</em> compte l’utilisation du jour ; rendez les 2 points de sorcellerie à la main.</p></section>",
